      <item row="2" column="1">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="remeshSurfaceCheckBox">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Retriangulate the surface into near equilateral cells of the target edge length before it is filled. Turn this off to fill the surface as it arrived, which is only worth doing when it is already meshed the way the solver wants it: the size of the tetrahedra follows the size of the triangles they sit against.</string>
